  "readme": "## README.md\n> **This dataset has moved.** It is now published, updated and extended as [Field blocks for Saxony, Germany](https://source.coop/ftw/harmonized-field-data/de_sax) in the [Harmonized Field Boundary Data](https://source.coop/ftw/harmonized-field-data) catalog. The files here are no longer updated.\n\n# Field boundaries for Saxony, Germany\n\nProvides ca. 100.000 official field boundaries from the federal state of Saxony in Germany.\nIt has been converted to a fiboa GeoParquet file from a file that was provided by the state.\n\n- **Source Data Provider:** [S\u00e4chsisches Landesamt f\u00fcr Umwelt, Landwirtschaft und Geologie](https://geoportal.sachsen.de/)\n- **Converted by:** [Matthias Mohr](https://mohr.ws)\n- **License:** [Germany - attribution - Version 2.0](https://www.govdata.de/dl-de/by-2-0)\n\n---\n\n- **[Download the data as fiboa GeoParquet](https://data.source.coop/fiboa/de-sax/de-sax.parquet)**\n- [STAC Browser](https://radiantearth.github.io/stac-browser/#/external/data.source.coop/fiboa/de-sax/stac/collection.json)\n- [STAC Collection](https://data.source.coop/fiboa/de-sax/stac/collection.json)\n- [PMTiles](https://data.source.coop/fiboa/de-sax/de-sax.pmtiles)\n\n## Lineage\n\n- Data downloaded on 2024-11-05 from https://www.smul.sachsen.de/gis-online/download/FBZ_ISS_Bereiche/gesamt_2024_RE.zip.\n- Converted to GeoParquet using [fiboa-cli](https://github.com/fiboa/cli), version 0.7.0.\n",
